<title>UK: PT Ongko prices $100 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>PT Ongko prices $100 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by joint lead managers Bank Boston and Bear Stearns, has</p>
<p>been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PT ONGKO</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    29.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE   LEASE-BACK    ISS PRICE  99.4642   PAY DATE  L-27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    99.4642   SPREAD	+400 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/BB	DENOMS (K) 100	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOVT BENCHMARK	 FEB 2004 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
